# Public API Rules

## src/index.ts is the only export surface

All public symbols must be re-exported from `src/index.ts`.
Internal modules should NOT be exported unless intentional.

## Export style
```ts
// Named re-exports only
export { MyClass } from "./my-class.js";
export type { MyClassOptions } from "./my-class.js";

// No default exports from index
```

## JSDoc required on all exports
```ts
/**
 * Parses a configuration object.
 *
 * @param input - Raw configuration object
 * @returns Validated configuration
 * @throws {ConfigError} If the input is invalid
 */
export function parseConfig(input: unknown): Config { ... }
```

## Versioning note
Any addition to `src/index.ts` is a public API change.
Run `pnpm changeset` after adding/removing exports.
